# Force LF line endings for source/text files regardless of the checkout
# platform's `core.autocrlf` default (#15 task 12: GitHub Actions'
# windows-latest runner defaults to converting LF -> CRLF on checkout,
# which then fails `cargo fmt --check` -- rustfmt requires LF). Windows
# is a Tier-1 platform for Brainprint, so this is a correctness fix, not
# a Windows-specific workaround applied only to CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary/generated files: never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
